OL,3,GNEWSACare home given more time to
OL,4,Aimprove - or face closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Aberdeenshire has been
OL,7,Fgiven more time to make significant
OL,8,Fimprovements - or risk closure.
OL,10,FBonnyton House, in Ellon, was served
OL,11,Fwith an improvement notice by the Care
OL,12,FInspectorate earlier this year, setting
OL,13,Fout requirements for the home to meet.
OL,15,FThe regulator said issues involving gas
OL,16,Fsafety, hot water and other potential
OL,17,Fhealth and safety risks had now been
OL,18,Faddressed.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
